## Architecture Profile Bench
aspect: us-comic
author: lazycomics
genre: benchmark
description: A neutral six-panel page for timing one Wan2GP architecture against another. One character per panel keeps every panel on the single-pass path so the timing reflects raw generation, not multi-inpaint passes.

